OL,3,GNEWSANew mega cranes 'keeping port in
OL,4,Athe premier league'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #60m investment has seen four of
OL,7,FEurope's biggest quay cranes delivered
OL,8,Fto Southampton docks.
OL,10,FThe cranes each weigh more than 2,000
OL,11,Ftonnes and stand nearly 150m high,
OL,12,Fmaking them among the tallest in the
OL,13,Fworld.
OL,15,FPort operator DP World said their
OL,16,Fability to do tandem lifts, unloading
OL,17,Ftwice as many heavy 40ft containers at
OL,18,Fonce, meant productivity would increase
OL,19,F"quite significantly" once all four
OL,20,Fwere operational.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
